[
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-001",
    "text": "If you have the words, there's always a chance that you'll find the way.",
    "author": "Seamus Heaney",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-002",
    "text": "It took me quite a long time to develop a voice, and now that I have it, I am not going to be silent.",
    "author": "Madeleine K. Albright",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-004",
    "text": "I'll never forget. I'll never give up. I'll never be quiet. I promise.",
    "author": "Angie Thomas",
    "source": "The Hate U Give",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-005",
    "text": "When we share those stories we've been scared to share, voicelessness loses its wicked grasp.",
    "author": "Jo Ann Fore",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:shame",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-006",
    "text": "Your voice is the most potent magic in existence.",
    "author": "Michael Bassey Johnson",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-009",
    "text": "You are closer than you think and more qualified in your message than you could ever fathom.",
    "author": "Rebecca Campbell",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-011",
    "text": "Three things I know to be true: You ARE a writer. The world is waiting for YOUR voice. Nobody can tell your story but YOU.",
    "author": "Jeanette LeBlanc",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-012",
    "text": "Finding your voice is a journey of discovering yourself.",
    "author": "Ute Wieczorek-King",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:growth",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-013",
    "text": "Finding your voice is about having the confidence to know you matter so you can use your voice.",
    "author": "Cammi Granato",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-014",
    "text": "The hardest part of finding my voice was finding the courage to believe my voice could actually make an impact.",
    "author": "Rosalie Fishon",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-018",
    "text": "When I'm hungry, I eat. When I'm thirsty, I drink. When I feel like saying something, I say it.",
    "author": "Madonna",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-019",
    "text": "Give voice to what you know to be true, and do not be afraid of being disliked or exiled.",
    "author": "Eve Ensler",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-020",
    "text": "We who have means and a voice must use them to help those who have neither.",
    "author": "Jennifer Donnelly",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:purpose",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-021",
    "text": "When the whole world is silent, even one voice becomes powerful.",
    "author": "Malala Yousafzai",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-022",
    "text": "When we speak we are afraid our words will not be heard or welcomed. But when we are silent, we are still afraid. So it is better to speak.",
    "author": "Audre Lorde",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-024",
    "text": "The most courageous act is still to think for yourself. Aloud.",
    "author": "Coco Chanel",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-025",
    "text": "Speak up and speak clearly. I want to hear what you have to say because it matters.",
    "author": "Felicia Johnson",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-026",
    "text": "Even when they refuse to listen, I'll keep talking anyway.",
    "author": "Nadege Richards",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-027",
    "text": "Our lives begin to end the day we become silent about the things that matter.",
    "author": "Martin Luther King Jr.",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:purpose",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-028",
    "text": "It only takes one voice, at the right pitch, to start an avalanche.",
    "author": "Dianna Hardy",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-029",
    "text": "Each of you has a distinctive voice. When you find it, your story will be told. You will be heard.",
    "author": "John Grisham",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-033",
    "text": "Stand before the people you fear and speak your mind — even if your voice shakes.",
    "author": "Maggie Kuhn",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-038",
    "text": "The one thing that you have that nobody else has is you. Your voice, your mind, your story, your vision.",
    "author": "Neil Gaiman",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-041",
    "text": "God put something in my heart to get across, and that's what I'm going to focus on — using my voice as an instrument and doing what needs to be done.",
    "author": "Kendrick Lamar",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:purpose",
      "theme:faith",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-048",
    "text": "If I have a platform and a voice, I should use it for my people.",
    "author": "Bad Bunny",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:purpose",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-050",
    "text": "The human voice is the first and most natural musical instrument, also the most emotional.",
    "author": "Klaus Schulze",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-051",
    "text": "If you hear a voice within you say 'you cannot paint,' then by all means paint, and that voice will be silenced.",
    "author": "Vincent Van Gogh",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-052",
    "text": "Real guts are nothing more than developing your inner voice to the point where it is louder and stronger than the voice of your fear.",
    "author": "Georgette Mosbacher",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-053",
    "text": "Listen to the inner voice that allows you to be you.",
    "author": "Elvis Stojko",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-054",
    "text": "Have the courage to follow your heart and intuition. They somehow already know what you truly want to become. Everything else is secondary.",
    "author": "Steve Jobs",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:purpose",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-057",
    "text": "Somewhere inside, we hear a voice. It leads us in the direction of the person we wish to become. But it is up to us whether or not to follow.",
    "author": "Pat Tillman",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "playful",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:purpose",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:playful"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-059",
    "text": "There is always one true inner voice. Trust it.",
    "author": "Gloria Steinem",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-062",
    "text": "Don't let the voices of other people's opinions drown out your own.",
    "author": "Steve Jobs",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-073",
    "text": "You were not born to stay quiet so other people feel comfortable.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-074",
    "text": "Stop shrinking yourself to fit into spaces that were never built for you.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-075",
    "text": "They told you to be quiet for so long that you forgot your voice was ever loud. It was. It still is.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-076",
    "text": "The world doesn't need a quieter version of you.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-077",
    "text": "You've been swallowing your words your whole life. It's time to spit them out.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-078",
    "text": "Say the thing. Say it clearly. Say it without apologizing.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-079",
    "text": "The moment you stop making yourself smaller for others is the moment everything changes.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-080",
    "text": "You don't need permission to take up space. You never did.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-081",
    "text": "Your silence is not keeping the peace. It's keeping you prisoner.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-082",
    "text": "Be so unapologetically yourself that people don't know what to do with you.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-083",
    "text": "Speak even when your voice shakes. Especially when your voice shakes.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-084",
    "text": "You are not too much. The people who said so were too little.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-085",
    "text": "One day you'll look back and be proud you didn't stay silent.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-086",
    "text": "Fear is not evil. It tells you what weakness is. And once you know your weakness, you can become stronger.",
    "author": "Gildarts Clive",
    "source": "Fairy Tail",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "emotion:fear",
      "theme:growth",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-087",
    "text": "Throughout heaven and earth, I alone am the honored one.",
    "author": "Satoru Gojo",
    "source": "Jujutsu Kaisen",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-088",
    "text": "If the System is trying to use me, then I will use the System.",
    "author": "Sung Jin-Woo",
    "source": "Solo Leveling",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-089",
    "text": "Nothing will ever be allowed to have any say in how we live… not even death itself.",
    "author": "Chobei Aza",
    "source": "Hell's Paradise",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-090",
    "text": "Your voice matters. Use it.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-091",
    "text": "Silence keeps peace, but costs truth.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-092",
    "text": "Your truth is your power.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-093",
    "text": "Be loud about what matters to you.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-094",
    "text": "Speak clearly. Speak boldly. Speak now.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-095",
    "text": "One honest sentence can shift everything.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-096",
    "text": "No one else can speak your truth.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-097",
    "text": "You were built to be heard.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-098",
    "text": "Your story deserves to be heard.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-099",
    "text": "Own your voice. It's yours alone.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-100",
    "text": "Say it scared. Say it anyway.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-101",
    "text": "Your silence won't protect you.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-102",
    "text": "The room changes when you speak up.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-103",
    "text": "Unspoken words weigh the most.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-104",
    "text": "Let them hear you.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-105",
    "text": "You have something worth saying.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-106",
    "text": "Raise your voice, not your doubt.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-107",
    "text": "Speak from your chest, not your fear.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "emotion:fear",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-108",
    "text": "Your opinion has a place here.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-109",
    "text": "Quiet kept you safe. Not free.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-110",
    "text": "You are likely extremely successful at something that feels natural, easy, or effortless, causing you to overlook it as a true skill.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "theme:identity",
      "need:validation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-111",
    "text": "Stop apologizing for taking up space.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:self-worth",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-113",
    "text": "Say no without guilt.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-114",
    "text": "You don't owe anyone your silence.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-115",
    "text": "The mic is yours. Use it.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-116",
    "text": "Your words carry weight. Choose power.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-117",
    "text": "Boundaries are spoken in full sentences.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:boundaries",
      "need:perspective",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-118",
    "text": "They can't silence what they can't ignore.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:direct",
      "tone:fierce"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-120",
    "text": "Your truth doesn't need permission.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "direct",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "need:permission",
      "tone:direct"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-121",
    "text": "Be the voice you needed growing up.",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "category": "empowerment",
    "subcategory": "finding-voice",
    "tone": "gentle",
    "tags": [
      "theme:identity",
      "theme:purpose",
      "need:motivation",
      "tone:gentle"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "emp-voice-122",
    "text": "Loud women change the world.",
